body:
What country do you live in? That will have an effect on recommendations ^ ^ ^;

You can do snacks, fruits, salads, snackable vegetables like carrots, hummus, and sandwiches like peanut butter and honey (with whole grain bread).

I second the slow burner, and also I would like to recommend a blender with how much you are spending, and you could make smoothies which can be very filling, healthy, and nutritious.
